{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sc1UJy3ssgxDAfoBFFKBhp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# worker exact task\n2\t\n3\tCorrect only outputs/greeting.txt under R1/D1 through actual public work.write. Acquire the deciding requirement/design/input and current output through the declared public source routes. Observe output separately immediately before write; use exact preimage and the selected write grant. No scratch files, shell redirection, other artifact mutation, model calls or next stage. Validate bytes in memory and retain actual native receipt. Evaluate worker-result and return the original closed result; candidate availability is not owner acceptance. The Executive consumes it. 600s is a ceiling; this is one tiny change, not a whole-corpus exercise.\n4\t\n5\tReturn exactly one a_c.fd-support.closed-return/1 JSON object. Copy frame={id,revision} from Context.packet.frame; activation from Context.boundaries.activation_identity; subject from packet.subject_basis.subject; basis={method_profile:packet.subject_basis.method_profile,observations:packet.subject_basis.observations}; actor={id:packet.actor_authority.actor_id,family/authorship exactly as stated below}; consumer=packet.evidence_relations.consumer. Other keys: id, evaluations, not_performed, work_result, residuals, invalidators. Each performed evaluation is {id,predicate:exact SourceRef from RETURN-CONTRACT,domain_outcome:your actual finding,core_value:satisfied|falsified|indeterminate|out_of_frame|invalid_basis,evidence:[actual SourceRef/ArtifactRef],residuals:[],invalidators:[]}. Worker work_result is {value:candidate_ready|incomplete|refused|re_entry_requested,cause,candidate:exact SourceRef or null,evidence:[actual acquired transition evidence],residuals:[]}; Reviewer work_result=null. Do not fabricate evaluations or replace original Context observations. No result interpreter or response repair is supplied.\n6\t\n7\t\n8\t## Selected successor after authentication failure\n9\t\n10\tThe preceding Claude Worker host failed authentication before construction. Its exact attempt is sha256:893360167954fa4ad5076b976f06bc4c4f9a2931550282566843c67f5d180890; capture/check preserve that failure. The output remains the original `Hello, Grace.\\n`. This is a new bounded activation of the same logical Worker, with the same R1/D1/territory/consumer and 600-second ceiling. The operator adjusted only the parent local MCP credential-name binding and phase-specific evidence paths. Do not inspect credentials or configuration. Acquire the task and deciding inputs through the declared public routes; construct the one tiny candidate through actual native work.write with fresh target preimage observation. No scratch writes or new model launches. Retain truthful failures; do not turn unavailable transport into a semantic result. Stop on authentication/capability failure without a workaround.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99e1b978-3749-4e94-9bdf-921d776df3c8","uuid":"f2b5d2c8-f783-4b5f-a360-9d7b8ff0a11d","timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:40:45.940Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/claude-handoff-3/control/actor-output/worker-auth-1/roles/worker-TASK.md","content":"# worker exact task\n\nCorrect only outputs/greeting.txt under R1/D1 through actual public work.write. Acquire the deciding requirement/design/input and current output through the declared public source routes. Observe output separately immediately before write; use exact preimage and the selected write grant. No scratch files, shell redirection, other artifact mutation, model calls or next stage. Validate bytes in memory and retain actual native receipt. Evaluate worker-result and return the original closed result; candidate availability is not owner acceptance. The Executive consumes it. 600s is a ceiling; this is one tiny change, not a whole-c